('tecno-phantom-v-fold2-12gb-512gb', 'Tecno Phantom V Fold 2 12GB RAM 512GB', 'smartphones', 950000, 950000, 780000, 8, 0.28, '/assets/products/tecno-phantom-v-fold2-12gb-512gb.jpg', 'The Tecno Phantom V Fold 2 represents a breakthrough in foldable technology made accessible. The stunning 7.85-inch 2K+ LTPO AMOLED inner display with 120Hz adaptive refresh and the 6.42-inch FHD+ AMOLED cover display both deliver flagship-level visuals. MediaTek Dimensity 9000+ processor with 12GB RAM (extendable to 24GB via Memory Fusion) and 512GB UFS 3.1 storage powers through multitasking, gaming, and productivity. The 50MP main camera with OIS, 50MP telephoto with 2x optical zoom, and 13MP ultra-wide capture versatile content. Dual 32MP selfie cameras (inner and cover) ensure perfect video calls. The 5000mAh battery with 45W wired and 15W wireless charging provides all-day endurance. HiOS based on Android 15 with AI features, stereo speakers, and Tecno''s refined hinge mechanism complete the premium package.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 780000, '/assets/products/tecno-phantom-v-fold2-12gb-512gb.jpg', 858000, 4.7, 1, 'Tecno', 1, 1),

('tecno-phantom-v-flip2-12gb-256gb', 'Tecno Phantom V Flip 2 12GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 720000, 720000, 590000, 12, 0.20, '/assets/products/tecno-phantom-v-flip2-12gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Tecno Phantom V Flip 2 brings stylish foldable innovation with its compact clamshell design. The 6.9-inch FHD+ AMOLED inner display with 120Hz and minimal crease delivers stunning visuals, while the 1.32-inch circular external display handles notifications, calls, and quick controls. MediaTek Dimensity 8050 processor with 12GB RAM ensures flagship responsiveness. The 64MP main camera with OIS and 13MP ultra-wide, plus a 32MP selfie camera, capture vibrant photos. The 4000mAh battery with 45W fast charging and HiOS Android 15 complete this fashion-forward device.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 590000, '/assets/products/tecno-phantom-v-flip2-12gb-256gb.jpg', 649000, 4.6, 0, 'Tecno', 1, 1),

('tecno-camon-50-premier-5g-12gb-512gb', 'Tecno Camon 50 Premier 5G 12GB RAM 512GB', 'smartphones', 520000, 520000, 425000, 12, 0.20, '/assets/products/tecno-camon-50-premier-5g-12gb-512gb.jpg', 'The Tecno Camon 50 Premier 5G is a camera powerhouse featuring a 50MP main sensor with advanced gimbal OIS, 50MP periscope telephoto with 3x optical zoom, and 50MP ultra-wide all powered by Tecno''s Universal Tone multi-skin tone imaging technology for natural, flattering portraits across all complexions. The 6.8-inch FHD+ AMOLED display with 120Hz and the Dimensity 8200 Ultimate 5G processor provide fluid performance. 512GB storage, 5000mAh battery with 70W ultra-fast charging (0-50% in 18 minutes), and HiOS with AI imaging tools make this the definitive camera phone for content creators.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 425000, '/assets/products/tecno-camon-50-premier-5g-12gb-512gb.jpg', 467500, 4.6, 0, 'Tecno', 1, 1),

('tecno-camon-50-pro-8gb-256gb', 'Tecno Camon 50 Pro 8GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 445389, 445389, 365000, 30, 0.195, '/assets/products/tecno-camon-50-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Tecno Camon 50 Pro is a camera-centric mid-ranger with a 50MP main camera featuring OIS, 50MP selfie camera with dual-tone LED flash for perfect low-light selfies, and AI-enhanced portrait algorithms. The 6.78-inch FHD+ AMOLED display with 120Hz refresh, MediaTek Helio G100 processor, 8GB RAM (extendable), and 256GB storage deliver smooth performance. The 5000mAh battery with 45W fast charging, HiOS with AI features, and premium vegan leather back design in four colors make it ideal for photography lovers and style-conscious users.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 365000, '/assets/products/tecno-camon-50-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 401500, 4.6, 0, 'Tecno', 0, 1),

('tecno-pova-6-pro-12gb-256gb', 'Tecno Pova 6 Pro 12GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 380000, 380000, 310000, 18, 0.22, '/assets/products/tecno-pova-6-pro-12gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Tecno Pova 6 Pro is engineered for gamers and power users. The MediaTek Dimensity 7200 processor with vapor chamber cooling and 12GB RAM handles demanding games at high settings. The 6.78-inch FHD+ AMOLED display with 120Hz and 1300 nits peak brightness provides an immersive gaming experience. The massive 7000mAh battery with 70W Ultra Charge delivers multi-day use and 0-50% in 20 minutes. Dynamic RGB lighting on the back, dual stereo speakers, and a 108MP main camera with 3x in-sensor zoom complete the gaming powerhouse package.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 310000, '/assets/products/tecno-pova-6-pro-12gb-256gb.jpg', 341000, 4.5, 0, 'Tecno', 0, 1),

('tecno-spark-30-pro-8gb-256gb', 'Tecno Spark 30 Pro 8GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 195000, 195000, 158000, 30, 0.20, '/assets/products/tecno-spark-30-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Tecno Spark 30 Pro features a 6.78-inch FHD+ display with 90Hz refresh and Dynamic Port for contextual notifications. MediaTek Helio G99 processor with 8GB RAM and 256GB storage handles daily tasks and gaming smoothly. The 108MP main camera captures detailed photos, while the 32MP selfie camera with dual flash excels in low light. 5000mAh battery with 33W fast charging, IP54 splash resistance, and dual speakers deliver an elevated budget experience.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 158000, '/assets/products/tecno-spark-30-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 173800, 4.4, 0, 'Tecno', 1, 0),

('tecno-spark-30-6gb-128gb', 'Tecno Spark 30 6GB RAM 128GB', 'smartphones', 155000, 155000, 125000, 40, 0.20, '/assets/products/tecno-spark-30-6gb-128gb.jpg', 'The Tecno Spark 30 delivers reliable everyday performance with its 6.67-inch HD+ display with 90Hz, MediaTek Helio G85 processor, and 6GB RAM with Memory Fusion up to 12GB. The 50MP AI dual camera and 8MP selfie camera capture social-media-ready photos. 5000mAh battery with 18W fast charging, side fingerprint sensor, and HiOS with Android 15 provide a smooth, secure experience. An outstanding value for students and first-time smartphone buyers.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 125000, '/assets/products/tecno-spark-30-6gb-128gb.jpg', 137500, 4.3, 0, 'Tecno', 1, 0),

('tecno-pop-20-4gb-64gb', 'Tecno POP 20 4GB RAM 64GB Android 16', 'smartphones', 136730, 136730, 112000, 45, 0.195, '/assets/products/tecno-pop-20-4gb-64gb.jpg', 'The Tecno POP 20 delivers exceptional value with a vibrant 6.67-inch HD+ display featuring 90Hz refresh rate for smooth scrolling. Unisoc T606 processor with 4GB RAM (extendable to 8GB) handles social media, streaming, and light gaming. The 5000mAh battery with 18W fast charging provides up to 2 days of use. 13MP AI dual camera with dual flash and 8MP selfie with flash capture clear photos. Android 16 (Go edition optimized), side fingerprint sensor, and IP54 splash resistance. Ideal for students, first-time users, and reliable everyday communication in Nigeria.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 112000, '/assets/products/tecno-pop-20-4gb-64gb.jpg', 123200, 4.5, 1, 'Tecno', 1, 1),

('tecno-pop-9-4gb-64gb', 'Tecno POP 9 4GB RAM 64GB', 'smartphones', 95000, 95000, 76000, 50, 0.18, '/assets/products/tecno-pop-9-4gb-64gb.jpg', 'The Tecno POP 9 is an ultra-affordable smartphone with a 6.6-inch HD+ 90Hz display, MediaTek Helio G36 processor, and 4GB RAM. The 13MP rear camera and 5MP front camera handle everyday photography. 5000mAh battery with 10W charging, rear fingerprint sensor, and Android 15 Go edition. The perfect first smartphone or backup device.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 76000, '/assets/products/tecno-pop-9-4gb-64gb.jpg', 83600, 4.2, 0, 'Tecno', 0, 0),

-- Tecno Audio
('tecno-sonic-2-tws', 'Tecno Sonic 2 True Wireless Earbuds', 'audio', 18500, 18500, 14800, 80, 0.045, '/assets/products/tecno-sonic-2-tws.jpg', 'Tecno Sonic 2 TWS earbuds feature 13mm dynamic drivers with Bass Boost+ technology for deep, punchy audio. Bluetooth 5.3, ENC noise cancellation for calls, and 36-hour total battery life (8 hours earbuds + 28 hours case). Low-latency gaming mode, IPX4 water resistance, and touch controls. USB-C fast charging: 10 minutes = 2 hours playback. Designed to complement Tecno smartphones with instant pairing.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 14800, '/assets/products/tecno-sonic-2-tws.jpg', 16280, 4.4, 0, 'Tecno', 0, 1),

('tecno-tws-neo-3', 'Tecno TWS Neo 3 Wireless Earbuds', 'audio', 12000, 12000, 9500, 100, 0.042, '/assets/products/tecno-tws-neo-3.jpg', 'Tecno TWS Neo 3 offers essential true wireless features with 10mm drivers, Bluetooth 5.2, 28-hour total battery, IPX4 rating, and touch controls. USB-C charging and instant pairing with Tecno/HiOs devices. An affordable entry into wireless audio.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 9500, '/assets/products/tecno-tws-neo-3.jpg', 10450, 4.3, 0, 'Tecno', 0, 0),

('tecno-soundbar-bt', 'Tecno Portable Bluetooth Soundbar Speaker', 'audio', 25000, 25000, 20000, 60, 0.35, '/assets/products/tecno-soundbar-bt.jpg', 'The Tecno Portable Bluetooth Soundbar delivers room-filling sound with dual 52mm full-range drivers and dual passive radiators. 20W total output, Bluetooth 5.3, AUX, microSD card playback, and USB-C charging. Built-in microphone for calls and 10-hour battery life. Compact design with carrying strap perfect for parties and outdoor gatherings.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 20000, '/assets/products/tecno-soundbar-bt.jpg', 22000, 4.3, 0, 'Tecno', 0, 0),

-- Tecno Power
('tecno-powerbank-10000', 'Tecno 10000mAh Fast Charge Power Bank USB-C', 'power', 9500, 9500, 7500, 130, 0.22, '/assets/products/tecno-powerbank-10000.jpg', 'Tecno 10000mAh Power Bank with dual USB output and USB-C input/output. 18W fast charging, LED battery indicator, and compact lightweight design (220g). Features overcharge, overdischarge, and short circuit protection. Charges most smartphones 2-2.5 times. Slim profile fits pockets and bags easily. Essential portable power for Tecno users.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 7500, '/assets/products/tecno-powerbank-10000.jpg', 8250, 4.4, 0, 'Tecno', 1, 0),

('tecno-powerbank-20000', 'Tecno 20000mAh Power Bank 22.5W', 'power', 17500, 17500, 14000, 100, 0.38, '/assets/products/tecno-powerbank-20000.jpg', 'Tecno 20000mAh high-capacity power bank with 22.5W fast charging via USB-C and dual USB-A outputs. Charge up to three devices simultaneously. Digital LED display shows remaining capacity. Smart charging IC automatically adjusts output for each device. Aircraft-grade aluminum alloy casing with anti-slip finish. Includes USB-C cable. Ideal for travelers and heavy smartphone users.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 14000, '/assets/products/tecno-powerbank-20000.jpg', 15400, 4.5, 0, 'Tecno', 0, 0),

-- Tecno Chargers
('tecno-25w-charger', 'Tecno 25W USB-C Fast Charger', 'chargers', 5500, 5500, 4200, 180, 0.07, '/assets/products/tecno-25w-charger.jpg', 'Tecno Genuine 25W USB-C fast charger optimized for all Tecno smartphones. Supports USB-PD 3.0 and Quick Charge 3.0. Compact design with universal 100-240V input. Built-in protection against overcurrent, overvoltage, and overheating. Charges compatible Tecno phones to 50% in 30 minutes.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 4200, '/assets/products/tecno-25w-charger.jpg', 4620, 4.5, 0, 'Tecno', 1, 0),

('tecno-usb-c-cable-2m', 'Tecno USB-C Fast Charging Cable 2m Braided', 'accessories', 3500, 3500, 2500, 250, 0.04, '/assets/products/tecno-usb-c-cable-2m.jpg', 'Tecno braided USB-C fast charging cable supports 25W fast charging and data sync. 2-meter length with nylon braided jacket for durability. Reinforced aluminum connector housings and strain relief. Compatible with all Tecno smartphones and any USB-C device.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 2500, '/assets/products/tecno-usb-c-cable-2m.jpg', 2750, 4.3, 0, 'Tecno', 0, 0),

