('infinix-zero-40-5g-12gb-256gb', 'Infinix Zero 40 5G 12GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 450000, 450000, 368000, 15, 0.21, '/assets/products/infinix-zero-40-5g-12gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Infinix Zero 40 5G is a premium mid-range device featuring a 6.78-inch FHD+ curved AMOLED display with 144Hz refresh rate and Corning Gorilla Glass 5. The MediaTek Dimensity 7200 Ultimate processor with 12GB RAM (extendable to 24GB) ensures flagship-level multitasking and gaming. The 108MP main camera with OIS, 50MP ultra-wide/macro, and 2MP depth sensor deliver versatile photography. A 50MP front camera with autofocus handles stunning selfies and 4K video calls. The 5000mAh battery with 68W HyperCharge (0-80% in 30 minutes) and 15W wireless charging provides all-day power. XOS 15 based on Android 15, JBL-tuned dual speakers, and an in-display fingerprint sensor complete the premium experience.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 368000, '/assets/products/infinix-zero-40-5g-12gb-256gb.jpg', 404800, 4.6, 0, 'Infinix', 1, 1),

('infinix-note-60-pro-12gb-512gb', 'Infinix Note 60 Pro 12GB RAM 512GB', 'smartphones', 680000, 680000, 555000, 10, 0.23, '/assets/products/infinix-note-60-pro-12gb-512gb.jpg', 'The Infinix Note 60 Pro pushes the Note series to flagship territory. The 6.9-inch FHD+ LTPO AMOLED display with 120Hz adaptive refresh delivers stunning visuals. MediaTek Dimensity 8200 Ultimate 5G processor with 12GB RAM and 512GB storage handles heavy multitasking and gaming. The triple 108MP camera system with OIS, 50MP periscope telephoto (5x optical), and 50MP ultra-wide provides pro-grade photography. All-Round FastCharge 2.0 at 100W charges the 5500mAh battery from 0-50% in 12 minutes. 50W wireless charging, JBL stereo speakers, XOS 15, and an IP53 rating complete this productivity powerhouse.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 555000, '/assets/products/infinix-note-60-pro-12gb-512gb.jpg', 610500, 4.7, 1, 'Infinix', 1, 1),

('infinix-note-60-pro-8gb-256gb', 'Infinix Note 60 Pro 8GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 559000, 559000, 455000, 25, 0.23, '/assets/products/infinix-note-60-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'Premium mid-ranger with 6.9-inch 120Hz AMOLED display, advanced camera system with OIS, ultra-fast 100W charging, in-display fingerprint, and sleek premium design. MediaTek Dimensity 8200 processor, 8GB RAM with 256GB storage, JBL-tuned audio, and XOS 15. Perfect for photography enthusiasts, gamers, and power users seeking flagship features at mid-range pricing.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 455000, '/assets/products/infinix-note-60-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 500500, 4.7, 1, 'Infinix', 1, 0),

('infinix-hot-50-pro-plus-8gb-256gb', 'Infinix Hot 50 Pro Plus 8GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 340000, 340000, 278000, 35, 0.22, '/assets/products/infinix-hot-50-pro-plus-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Infinix Hot 50 Pro Plus features a 6.8-inch FHD+ AMOLED display with 120Hz and a sleek ultra-slim profile (7.4mm). MediaTek Helio G100 Ultimate processor with 8GB RAM (extendable to 16GB) handles gaming and multitasking. 50MP main camera with OIS, 50MP selfie, 5000mAh battery with 45W fast charge, and IP54 resistance. JBL-tuned dual speakers and the Folax AI voice assistant.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 278000, '/assets/products/infinix-hot-50-pro-plus-8gb-256gb.jpg', 305800, 4.5, 0, 'Infinix', 0, 1),

('infinix-hot-50-6gb-128gb', 'Infinix Hot 50 6GB RAM 128GB', 'smartphones', 220000, 220000, 178000, 40, 0.21, '/assets/products/infinix-hot-50-6gb-128gb.jpg', 'The Infinix Hot 50 is a reliable everyday performer with a 6.7-inch HD+ display featuring 120Hz refresh. MediaTek Helio G88 processor with 6GB RAM handles apps and games smoothly. 50MP AI dual camera, 8MP selfie with flash, 5000mAh battery with 33W fast charging, and XOS 15. Stereo speakers and side fingerprint sensor. An excellent value all-rounder.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 178000, '/assets/products/infinix-hot-50-6gb-128gb.jpg', 195800, 4.3, 0, 'Infinix', 0, 0),

('infinix-smart-20-4gb-64gb', 'Infinix Smart 20 4GB RAM 64GB Android 16', 'smartphones', 136670, 136670, 112000, 60, 0.205, '/assets/products/infinix-smart-20-4gb-64gb.jpg', 'The Infinix Smart 20 is a feature-rich budget smartphone with a massive 6.78-inch HD+ display with 90Hz and Panda Glass protection. MediaTek Helio G81 processor, 4GB RAM (extendable to 8GB), and 64GB storage. 50MP AI dual camera with quad flash, 5000mAh battery with 18W fast charging, and DTS audio enhancement. Android 16 Go edition, IP54 splash resistance, and side fingerprint sensor. The perfect entry-level smartphone for first-time users, students, and reliable daily communication in Nigeria.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 112000, '/assets/products/infinix-smart-20-4gb-64gb.jpg', 123200, 4.4, 1, 'Infinix', 1, 0),

('infinix-gt-20-pro-12gb-256gb', 'Infinix GT 20 Pro 12GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 480000, 480000, 392000, 15, 0.22, '/assets/products/infinix-gt-20-pro-12gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Infinix GT 20 Pro is a gaming-focused device with a dedicated Pixelworks X7 display chip for frame interpolation and HDR enhancement. The 6.78-inch FHD+ AMOLED display with 144Hz delivers buttery-smooth gaming. Dimensity 8200 Ultimate with 12GB RAM and vapor chamber cooling keeps temperatures low during extended sessions. 108MP main camera, JBL stereo speakers, 5000mAh battery with 100W HyperCharge, and customizable RGB mini-LED lights on the back. X-Boost gaming mode optimizes performance and network latency.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 392000, '/assets/products/infinix-gt-20-pro-12gb-256gb.jpg', 431200, 4.6, 0, 'Infinix', 0, 1),

